    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROTECT THE FURNACE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the furnace safe! If damaged, it stops yielding gold, and if destroyed, the battle is lost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3f68d056abf69b55323c9118c58b1052.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3f68d056abf69b55323c9118c58b1052.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3f68d056abf69b55323c9118c58b1052.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILDING </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cannons, barricades and bombs to hold off waves of goblins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/be0536f93ed50a89405ea6c74ee99aa6.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/be0536f93ed50a89405ea6c74ee99aa6.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/be0536f93ed50a89405ea6c74ee99aa6.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rifle to eliminate the goblins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/800235a14d1ab3e79703c6d01b91897b.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/800235a14d1ab3e79703c6d01b91897b.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/800235a14d1ab3e79703c6d01b91897b.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REPAIR AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hammer to repair and upgrade buildings to increase your chances of victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3990d5c2b8f4ae705de05e7df66123af.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3990d5c2b8f4ae705de05e7df66123af.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3990d5c2b8f4ae705de05e7df66123af.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NIGHT MODE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the challenge, double the reward, and double the fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/17214bcc4d333f31d53ee088103d10c3.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/17214bcc4d333f31d53ee088103d10c3.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/17214bcc4d333f31d53ee088103d10c3.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROTECT THE FURNACE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the furnace safe! If damaged, it stops yielding gold, and if destroyed, the battle is lost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3f68d056abf69b55323c9118c58b1052.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3f68d056abf69b55323c9118c58b1052.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3f68d056abf69b55323c9118c58b1052.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILDING </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cannons, barricades and bombs to hold off waves of goblins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/be0536f93ed50a89405ea6c74ee99aa6.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/be0536f93ed50a89405ea6c74ee99aa6.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/be0536f93ed50a89405ea6c74ee99aa6.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your rifle to eliminate the goblins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/800235a14d1ab3e79703c6d01b91897b.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/800235a14d1ab3e79703c6d01b91897b.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/800235a14d1ab3e79703c6d01b91897b.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REPAIR AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hammer to repair and upgrade buildings to increase your chances of victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3990d5c2b8f4ae705de05e7df66123af.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3990d5c2b8f4ae705de05e7df66123af.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/3990d5c2b8f4ae705de05e7df66123af.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NIGHT MODE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the challenge, double the reward, and double the fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/17214bcc4d333f31d53ee088103d10c3.poster.avif?t=1741431335\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/17214bcc4d333f31d53ee088103d10c3.webm?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807130/extras/17214bcc4d333f31d53ee088103d10c3.mp4?t=1741431335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
